================================================================================
PART C — UPSTREAM CALIBRATION DATA
================================================================================
The raw detector images underlying the cross-detector zoo
(MIDAS/FF_HEDM/Example/Calibration/*.tiff, *.ge1) are distributed by the
MIDAS project (https://github.com/marinerhemant/MIDAS) under its
respective license. APEXA-Bench redistributes derived products
(integrated lineouts, refined cell parameters) but does not redistribute
the raw images.
